<title>USA: Uruguay buys one mln bbls of Iranian Heavy crude.</title>
<headline>Uruguay buys one mln bbls of Iranian Heavy crude.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uruguay's state oil refiner ANCAP bought one million barrels of Iranian Heavy crude from Brazil's state oil company Petrobras, trade sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>ANCAP paid between $1.20-30 a barrel under Dated Brent crude on a cost and freight basis, the sources said.</p>
<p>The crude will be delivered in the second half of August to the Jose Ignacio terminal.</p>
<p>((--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk +1 212 859 1620))</p>
</text>
